SentinelWire UNIVERSAL-DEFENSE Wireshark Profile
---------------------------------------
Purpose: Initial SOC triage and unknown threat detection.

Includes:
- ARP Spoofing detection
- MITM indicators
- DNS Hijacking & tunneling
- SYN scan anomalies
- TLS anomalies
- Long-domain covert channels

Use make_ws_profile.bat to personalize IP/MAC values.
